---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
const title = "Free Text and Developer Tools: Count, Format, Encode and Test - Toolkit Lab";
const description = "Free online text and developer tools: word counter, case converter, JSON and CSV converters, Base64, URL encoding, regex tester, hashes and more.";
---
<Base title={title} description={description} path="/text-and-developer-tools.html">
  <aside class="ad-rail" aria-label="Advertisement"><div class="ad-slot ad-slot-rail"></div></aside>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="tool-head">
      <p class="crumbs"><a href="/index.html">Home</a> / Text and Developer Tools</p>
      <h1>Free text and developer tools</h1>
      <p class="lead">Text and developer tools save time on everyday editing and coding tasks. Count words, change capitalisation, format JSON, convert CSV, encode a URL, or test a pattern. Each one runs in your browser, so pasted text and code are not sent to a server.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="ad-slot" aria-label="Advertisement"></div>
    <section class="block">
      <div class="grid">
        <a class="card" href="/tools/word-counter.html"><span class="card-icon">WOR</span><h3>Word Counter</h3><p>Words, characters, sentences and estimated reading time.</p></a>
        <a class="card" href="/tools/case-converter.html"><span class="card-icon">CAS</span><h3>Case Converter</h3><p>Switch text to UPPERCASE, Title Case, camelCase, snake_case and more.</p></a>
        <a class="card" href="/tools/json-formatter.html"><span class="card-icon">JSO</span><h3>JSON Formatter</h3><p>Beautify, minify and validate JSON with clear error messages.</p></a>
        <a class="card" href="/tools/csv-to-json.html"><span class="card-icon">CSV</span><h3>CSV to JSON Converter</h3><p>Turn spreadsheet CSV text into JSON objects.</p></a>
        <a class="card" href="/tools/markdown-preview.html"><span class="card-icon">MAR</span><h3>Markdown Preview</h3><p>Write Markdown and see it formatted as you type.</p></a>
        <a class="card" href="/tools/base64.html"><span class="card-icon">BAS</span><h3>Base64 Encoder</h3><p>Encode text to Base64 and decode it back.</p></a>
        <a class="card" href="/tools/url-encoder.html"><span class="card-icon">URL</span><h3>URL Encoder and Decoder</h3><p>Percent-encode text for web addresses, or decode it.</p></a>
        <a class="card" href="/tools/url-slug-generator.html"><span class="card-icon">URL</span><h3>URL Slug Generator</h3><p>Turn a title into a clean lowercase slug.</p></a>
        <a class="card" href="/tools/unix-timestamp-converter.html"><span class="card-icon">UNI</span><h3>Unix Timestamp Converter</h3><p>Convert epoch seconds to a date, or a date to a timestamp.</p></a>
        <a class="card" href="/tools/regex-tester.html"><span class="card-icon">REG</span><h3>Regex Tester</h3><p>Test a regular expression and see each match highlighted.</p></a>
        <a class="card" href="/tools/hash-generator.html"><span class="card-icon">HAS</span><h3>Hash Generator</h3><p>Calculate SHA-256, SHA-512 and other hashes.</p></a>
        <a class="card" href="/tools/roman-numeral-converter.html"><span class="card-icon">ROM</span><h3>Roman Numeral Converter</h3><p>Convert numbers 1 to 3999 to Roman numerals, and back.</p></a>
        <a class="card" href="/tools/lorem-ipsum-generator.html"><span class="card-icon">LOR</span><h3>Lorem Ipsum Generator</h3><p>Placeholder text for mockups and layouts.</p></a>
        <a class="card" href="/tools/password-generator.html"><span class="card-icon">PAS</span><h3>Password Generator</h3><p>Create strong random passwords on your device.</p></a>
        <a class="card" href="/tools/password-strength-checker.html"><span class="card-icon">PAS</span><h3>Password Strength Checker</h3><p>Estimate how strong a password is, checked on your device.</p></a>
        <a class="card" href="/tools/qr-code-generator.html"><span class="card-icon">QR </span><h3>QR Code Generator</h3><p>Turn a link or text into a QR code.</p></a>
        <a class="card" href="/tools/color-converter.html"><span class="card-icon">COL</span><h3>Color Converter</h3><p>Switch between HEX, RGB and HSL.</p></a>
        <a class="card" href="/tools/text-diff-checker.html"><span class="card-icon">TEX</span><h3>Text Diff Checker</h3><p>Compare two texts and see which lines changed.</p></a>
        <a class="card" href="/tools/typing-speed-test.html"><span class="card-icon">TYP</span><h3>Typing Speed Test</h3><p>Measure words per minute and accuracy.</p></a>
        <a class="card" href="/tools/stopwatch.html"><span class="card-icon">ONL</span><h3>Online Stopwatch</h3><p>Start, pause and record laps.</p></a>
        <a class="card" href="/tools/random-number-generator.html"><span class="card-icon">RAN</span><h3>Random Number Generator</h3><p>Pick random numbers in a range, with or without repeats.</p></a>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="block faq-block" style="grid-template-columns:1fr">
      <h2 class="block-title" style="text-align:left">Questions</h2>
      <div class="faq">
        <details><summary>Is my text saved?</summary><p>No. Text and code are processed in your browser and are not stored or sent.</p></details>
        <details><summary>Can I use these for work?</summary><p>Yes. They are free and have no sign-up.</p></details>
      </div>
    </section>
    <div class="ad-slot" aria-label="Advertisement"></div>
  </div>
  <aside class="ad-rail" aria-label="Advertisement"><div class="ad-slot ad-slot-rail"></div></aside>
</Base>
